# 🏗️ Main Project

## Project: TeamFlow — Project & Team Operations Platform

TeamFlow is a backend platform for organizations to manage:

* Organizations
* Teams
* Projects
* Project Members
* Tasks
* Task Assignments
* Task Dependencies
* Sprints
* Labels
* Comments
* Time Tracking
* Notifications
* Activity History
* Search and Reporting
* AI-assisted project operations

The project should evolve throughout the six sprints.

The learner should **not** build six disconnected mini-projects.

Every sprint extends and improves the same system.

