# ⏱️ Suggested 2-Week Sprint Structure

Each sprint represents approximately:

```text
Week 1
────────────────────────
Learning + Implementation
        ↓
Core Feature Development
        ↓
Mentor Review

Week 2
────────────────────────
Advanced Implementation
        ↓
Debugging
        ↓
Refactoring
        ↓
Code Review
        ↓
Finalization
```

With approximately:

```text
15 hours/week
≈ 30 hours/sprint
```

The exact split should remain flexible depending on the learner's progress.

