# 🔍 Engineering Expectations

Throughout all six sprints, learners should repeatedly practice:

### Debugging

```text
Symptom
   ↓
Observation
   ↓
Hypothesis
   ↓
Experiment
   ↓
Evidence
   ↓
Root Cause
   ↓
Fix
   ↓
Prevention
```

### Performance

```text
Measure
   ↓
Find Bottleneck
   ↓
Understand Root Cause
   ↓
Optimize
   ↓
Measure Again
```

### Architecture

Before introducing a pattern or abstraction, ask:

```text
What problem are we solving?

Why is the current solution insufficient?

What are the alternatives?

What complexity does this abstraction introduce?

Is it actually needed?
```

